\ box-map.8th -- Thinking 8th, Chapter 8
\ Verified with: 8th code/ch08/box-map.8th
\
\ A map bundles several related values under one name -- the direct
\ 8th answer to Brodie's CREATE/DOES>-built state table.

{ "top" : 0 , "bottom" : 0 , "left" : 0 , "right" : 0 } var, box

box @ "top" 10 m:! drop
box @ "top" m:@ . cr drop    \ => 10

bye
